.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGc9APgWdG48obzCP0QY_-o-mXOxbd8btdYlaP1oR0Ebw&oe=6A8041A8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "iLauncher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "iLauncher is a simple VR app launcher that provides a dedicated 3D launch environment for browsing and opening installed apps.\n\nUsers can view all installed apps in one place, and iLauncher can also create a dedicated company app page based on user-provided company information. This makes it useful for enterprise showcases, education, training, medical demonstrations, exhibitions, and multi-app VR projects.\n\nThe current version supports app browsing, app launching, a company app page, app uninstalling, and system time adjustment. iLauncher is focused on providing a clean, stable, and easy-to-use entry point for VR content.\n\nKey Features\n\n\ud83c\udf10 Immersive 3D Launcher Space\nBrowse and launch apps inside a dedicated 3D environment.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 All Installed Apps in One Place\nView all installed apps in one organized place.\n\n\ud83c\udfe2 Company App Page\nCreate a dedicated page for company-related apps based on user-provided company information.\n\n\ud83e\udde9 App Management\nUninstall apps directly from the launcher interface.\n\n\ud83d\udd52 System Time Adjustment\nAdjust system time for managed devices, offline demos, training setups, or fixed-use environments.", "short_description": "iLauncher is a simple VR app launcher that provides an immersive 3D launch space, displays installed apps, and creates a dedicated company app page based on user-provided company information. It is designed for demos, education, training, enterprise showcases, and organized VR content access."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dejevis.com/iLauncher_privacy__for_meta", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Suzhou Dejevis Digital Technology Co., Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_ur